{"id":"f9f220f2e2969a98","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-model-elementary-chain.md","title":"ZFC Model Elementary Chain","display":"df-zfc-model-elementary-chain — ZFC Model Elementary Chain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-elementary-chain","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-elementary-chain"],"display":"df-zfc-model-elementary-chain — ZFC Model Elementary Chain","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-elementary-chain]]","[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-elementary-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-elementary-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-elementary-chain — ZFC Model Elementary Chain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e2db788b9ba8ebdc\" href=\"?note=e2db788b9ba8ebdc\" title=\"58-df-zfc-elementary-chain\">58-df-zfc-elementary-chain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec M,\\mathcal A,\\delta,L\\in V\">\\(\\vec M,\\mathcal A,\\delta,L\\in V\\)</span> (chain, ambient structure, ordinal length, and language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S,\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S,\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_L\">\\(\\prec_L\\)</span> (symbols from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelElementaryChain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelElementaryChain}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelElementaryChain}_S(\\vec M,\\mathcal A,\\delta,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S(\\vec M,\\delta,\\in\\cap(\\delta\\times\\delta),L)\\land\\forall i\\in\\delta\\;(\\vec M(i)\\prec_L\\mathcal A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelElementaryChain}_S(\\vec M,\\mathcal A,\\delta,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryChain}_S(\\vec M,\\delta,\\in\\cap(\\delta\\times\\delta),L)\\land\\forall i\\in\\delta\\;(\\vec M(i)\\prec_L\\mathcal A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical elementary-chain predicate supplies function typing and pairwise elementarity; the final clause places every member inside the specified ambient structure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-elementary-chain